{"info": {"author": null, "author_email": "kevinheavey <kevinheavey123@gmail.com>", "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": [], "description": "# AnchorPy\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kevinheavey/anchorpy/main/docs/img/logo.png\" width=\"40%\" height=\"40%\">\n</div>\n\n---\n\n[![Discord Chat](https://img.shields.io/discord/889577356681945098?color=blueviolet)](https://discord.gg/sxy4zxBckh)  \n\nAnchorPy is the gateway to interacting with [Anchor](https://github.com/project-serum/anchor) programs in Python.\nIt provides:\n\n- A static client generator\n- A dynamic client similar to `anchor-ts`\n- A Pytest plugin\n- A CLI with various utilities for Anchor Python development.\n\nRead the [Documentation](https://kevinheavey.github.io/anchorpy/).\n\n\n\n## Installation (requires Python >=3.9)\n\n```sh\npip install anchorpy[cli, pytest]\n\n```\nOr, if you're not using the CLI or Pytest plugin features of AnchorPy you can just run `pip install anchorpy`.\n\n### Development Setup\n\nIf you want to contribute to AnchorPy, follow these steps to get set up:\n\n1. Install [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/)\n2. Run the unit tests:\n```sh\nuv run --all-extras pytest tests/unit\n\n```\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": null, "home_page": null, "keywords": null, "license": null, "license_expression": null, "license_files": ["LICENSE"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "anchorpy", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/anchorpy/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/anchorpy/", "project_urls": {"Documentation": "https://kevinheavey.github.io/anchorpy/", "Repository": "https://github.com/kevinheavey/anchorpy"}, "provides_extra": ["cli", "pytest"], "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/anchorpy/0.21.0/", "requires_dist": ["anchorpy-core<0.3,>=0.2.0", "based58<0.2,>=0.1.1", "borsh-construct<0.2,>=0.1.0", "construct-typing<0.6,>=0.5.1", "pyheck<0.2,>=0.1.4", "solana<1.0,>=0.36.1", "solders<1.0,>=0.21.0", "toml<0.11,>=0.10.2", "toolz<0.12,>=0.11.2", "autoflake~=1.4; extra == \"cli\"", "black<23,>=22.3.0; extra == \"cli\"", "genpy~=2021.1; extra == \"cli\"", "ipython<9,>=8.0.1; extra == \"cli\"", "typer==0.4.1; extra == \"cli\"", "py<2,>=1.11.0; extra == \"pytest\"", "pytest-asyncio<0.22,>=0.21.0; extra == \"pytest\"", "pytest-xprocess<0.19,>=0.18.1; extra == \"pytest\"", "pytest<8,>=7.2.0; extra == \"pytest\""], "requires_python": "~=3.9", "summary": "The Python Anchor client.", "version": "0.21.0", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "releases": {"0.9.2": [{"comment_text": "", "core-metadata": {"sha256": "8d57ff65823a30f5031d0d3421660de4571b2daef5e6caa6874272fc8ddd75c0"}, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "4832401be513c799111630e493ef92cca06f01f513ec6cd6c570cfbc5c233819", "md5": "e49aecff4f02b37f89d700526892ed61", "sha256": "d977ada7b800507b05ebcec43f4dbcbbb1217e47cf3eda5cb30b32e47e997bc2"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "anchorpy-0.9.2-py3-none-any.whl", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "e49aecff4f02b37f89d700526892ed61", "packagetype": "bdist_wheel", "python_version": "py3", "requires_python": ">=3.9,<4.0", "size": 60207, "upload_time": "2022-06-02T18:14:53", "upload_time_iso_8601": "2022-06-02T18:14:53.663002Z", "url": "https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/48/32/401be513c799111630e493ef92cca06f01f513ec6cd6c570cfbc5c233819/anchorpy-0.9.2-py3-none-any.whl", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, {"comment_text": "", "core-metadata": false, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "ab57a83ca1528615fd5d49f3ce36e80a0f7b8bbd773171fa59367aa0f1b4fffd", "md5": "b364f0078ae0ab46b6cd132a608e652f", "sha256": "dd1619e4322d9dbeeaafe648b5559cd6051b393cda62fe9694537ba6a529e563"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "anchorpy-0.9.2.tar.gz", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "b364f0078ae0ab46b6cd132a608e652f", "packagetype": "sdist", "py